msprimeR bundles third-party C libraries:

* msprime C library (src/lib/)
  Copyright (C) 2015-2025 University of Oxford.
  License: GPL (>= 3).
  https://github.com/tskit-dev/msprime

* tskit C library (src/tskit/, src/tskit.h)
  Copyright (c) 2019-2025 Tskit Developers; (c) 2015-2018 University of Oxford.
  License: MIT (see inst/licenses/tskit-MIT.txt; individual source files also
  retain the upstream MIT notice).
  https://github.com/tskit-dev/tskit

* kastore (src/kastore/)
  Copyright (c) 2018 tskit-dev.
  License: MIT (see inst/licenses/kastore-MIT.txt).
  https://github.com/tskit-dev/kastore

* avl.c/avl.h (src/lib/): libavl,
  Copyright (C) 1998 Michael H. Buselli, (C) 2000-2002 Wessel Dankers.
  License: GNU LGPL version 2.1 or any later version (full text in
  inst/licenses/LGPL-2.1.txt).

The vendored sources are unmodified except for the small changes applied by
tools/sync_c_sources.sh: internal assertion failures are reported through R's
error mechanism instead of writing to stderr and calling abort(), the tskit
debug stream defaults to NULL, and a void function in avl.c no longer returns
an expression.
